# Normalise line endings.
#
# The files were uploaded through the GitHub web UI (LF) and checked out on Windows
# (CRLF), which made git report every single file as fully modified - 62 insertions and
# 62 deletions on a 62-line file, with no actual content change. This tells git to store
# text as LF and convert on checkout, so those phantom diffs stop.
#
# After adding this, run once:  git add --renormalize .
* text=auto

*.py    text diff=python
*.md    text
*.html  text
*.json  text
*.bat   text eol=crlf
